            "description": {
              "value": "By drawing upon the First World's magic, you can siphon a portion of that malleable world to create a convincing illusion. Once per day, you can cast illusory disguise, item facade, or ventriloquism."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "levelled_description",
          "stats": {
